title: Image-sequence anomaly detection on MongoDB Atlas Vector Search
summary: Caption-then-embed pipeline that learns from a project's normal frames and scores new images by cosine distance from the centroid. Per-tile heatmaps, polygon annotations, and a human-correction loop that feeds back into the next training run.
